{"unit_id":"zhifengjiang__dsh-hover-archive#feature-1","repo":"zhifengjiang/dsh-hover-archive","commit":"430491ab1e36db6019a7d6d11b2f7506e5c2915d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-archive 的功能「侧边栏归档」：在可操作的会话行末尾添加按钮，悬停或键盘聚焦时显示。点击按钮会归档该行对应的会话，不打开会话本身。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:70-85","src/client.js:93-107","src/client.js:168-179"]}
